 работайте откуда угодно</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div className=\"about-mission\">\n            <h3>Наша миссия</h3>\n            <p>\n              Мы верим, что правильные инструменты могут сделать людей более продуктивными и креативными. \n              Kaya разработан для того, чтобы помочь вам сосредоточиться на важном, \n              а не на управлении информацией.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default About;\n"],"mappings":"AAAA,MAAO,CAAAA,KAAK,KAAM,OAAO,CACzB,MAAO,aAAa,CAAC,OAAAC,GAAA,IAAAC,IAAA,CAAAC,IAAA,IAAAC,KAAA,yBAErB,QAAS,CAAAC,KAAKA,CAAA,CAAG,CACf,mBACEH,IAAA,YAASI,EAAE,CAAC,OAAO,CAACC,SAAS,CAAC,OAAO,CAAAC,QAAA,cACnCN,IAAA,QAAKK,SAAS,CAAC,iBAAiB,CAAAC,QAAA,cAC9BJ,KAAA,QAAKG,SAAS,CAAC,eAAe,CAAAC,QAAA,eAC5BN,IAAA,OAAAM,QAAA,CAAI,wDAAc,CAAI,CAAC,cACvBN,IAAA,MAAAM,QAAA,CAAG,kqCAIH,CAAG,CAAC,cAEJJ,KAAA,QAAKG,SAAS,CAAC,gBAAgB,CAAAC,QAAA,eAC7BJ,KAAA,QAAKG,SAAS,CAAC,eAAe,CAAAC,QAAA,eAC5BN,IAAA,QAAKK,SAAS,CAAC,gBAAgB,CAAAC,QAAA,CAAC,GAAC,CAAK,CAAC,cACvCN,IAAA,OAAAM,QAAA,CAAI,iIAAsB,CAAI,CAAC,cAC/BN,IAAA,MAAAM,QAAA,CAAG,oVAA+D,CAAG,CAAC,EACnE,CAAC,cAENJ,KAAA,QAAKG,SAAS,CAAC,eAAe,CAAAC,QAAA,eAC5BN,IAAA,QAAKK,SAAS,CAAC,gBAAgB,CAAAC,QAAA,CAAC,GAAC,CAAK,CAAC,cACvCN,IAAA,OAAAM,QAAA,CAAI,0EAAY,CAAI,CAAC,cACrBN,IAAA,MAAAM,QAAA,CAAG,2WAAkE,CAAG,CAAC,EACtE,CAAC,cAENJ,KAAA,QAAKG,SAAS,CAAC,eAAe,CAAAC,QAAA,eAC5BN,IAAA,QAAKK,SAAS,CAAC,gBAAgB,CAAAC,QAAA,CAAC,GAAC,CAAK,CAAC,cACvCN,IAAA,OAAAM,QAAA,CAAI,6FAAgB,CAAI,CAAC,cACzBN,IAAA,MAAAM,QAAA,CAAG,8UAA8D,CAAG,CAAC,EAClE,CAAC,cAENJ,KAAA,QAAKG,SAAS,CAAC,eAAe,CAAAC,QAAA,eAC5BN,IAAA,QAAKK,SAAS,CAAC,gBAAgB,CAAAC,QAAA,CAAC,GAAC,CAAK,CAAC,cACvCN,IAAA,OAAAM,QAAA,CAAI,4EAAc,CAAI,CAAC,cACvBN,IAAA,MAAAM,QAAA,CAAG,4TAA2D,CAAG,CAAC,EAC/D,CAAC,EACH,CAAC,cAENJ,KAAA,QAAKG,SAAS,CAAC,eAAe,CAAAC,QAAA,eAC5BN,IAAA,OAAAM,QAAA,CAAI,+DAAW,CAAI,CAAC,cACpBN,IAAA,MAAAM,QAAA,CAAG,y9BAIH,CAAG,CAAC,EACD,CAAC,EACH,CAAC,CACH,CAAC,CACC,CAAC,CAEd,CAEA,cAAe,CA